DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
7575::$$$message_0053_0000_0000$$$::"Fwaahh..."[lr]::
7576::$$$message_0053_0000_0001$$$::I stretch in the temple courtyard. It's a beautiful day.[lr]::
7577::$$$message_0053_0000_0002$$$::As I'm wondering what to do with the rest of my morning...[lr]::
7578::$$$message_0053_0000_0003$$$::"Oh, Emiyan. What's up? Here for some early morning prayer?"[lr]::
7579::$$$message_0053_0000_0004$$$::Neko enters through the temple gate with a clatter.::
7580::$$$message_0053_0001_0000$$$::"Good morning, Neko.[lr]::
7581::$$$message_0053_0001_0001$$$::Um, is today..."[lr]::
7582::$$$message_0053_0001_0002$$$::I don't need to finish the question.[lr]::
7583::$$$message_0053_0001_0003$$$::Neko is hauling a large package with both hands.[lr]::
7584::$$$message_0053_0001_0004$$$::It's a mountain of beer bottles and sake, possibly twenty kilos' worth at a glance.::
7585::$$$message_0053_0002_0000$$$::"...Did you haul all that here yourself?"[lr]::
7586::$$$message_0053_0002_0001$$$::"Yeah? Who else was gonna do it?[lr]::
7587::$$$message_0053_0002_0002$$$::It's not like we've got a delivery driver on call."[lr]::
7588::$$$message_0053_0002_0003$$$::She looks genuinely confused that I asked.[lr]::
7589::$$$message_0053_0002_0004$$$::Maybe this is just business as usual for her.::
7590::$$$message_0053_0003_0000$$$::"...Neko. Please ask me to deliver to Ryudou Temple going forward. It's too much for one person."[lr]::
7591::$$$message_0053_0003_0001$$$::"That's mighty considerate of you, Emiyan.[lr]::
7592::$$$message_0053_0003_0002$$$::But it's okay. I'm used to this, and lately I've been taking a car until the base of the stairs, so it's no biggie.[lr]::
7593::$$$message_0053_0003_0003$$$::Still, I'm happy you're so considerate. So happy that I want to give you a 10-yen raise next pay period."::
7594::$$$message_0053_0004_0000$$$::"See ya," she says, as she walks off to the temple building.[lr]::
7595::$$$message_0053_0004_0001$$$::"I'll take that. You just need to bring them to the kitchen, right?"[lr]::
7596::$$$message_0053_0004_0002$$$::"Yeah. You don't have to. [cacheimage storage=ネコ01b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ネコ01b(中)]Does make it easier on me, so okay."[lr]::
7597::$$$message_0053_0004_0003$$$::I take the case of beer to her left.::
7598::$$$message_0053_0005_0000$$$::"Whoa, this is way more than twenty kilos![lr]::
7599::$$$message_0053_0005_0001$$$::What did you put in here, Neko!?"[lr]::
7600::$$$message_0053_0005_0002$$$::"We run a bar, remember? Beer, nihonshu, whisky, brandy... Oh, they ordered some laojiu, too.[lr]::
7601::$$$message_0053_0005_0003$$$::The trick is to carry no more than your body weight. That way you can spread the weight easily, and even a girl like me can manage with a bit of effort."::
7602::$$$message_0053_0006_0000$$$::Chatting side by side, we head for the temple kitchen.[lr]::
7603::$$$message_0053_0006_0001$$$::From afar, we might resemble crabs.::
7604::$$$message_0053_0007_0000$$$::We set our load down in the kitchen.[lr]::
7605::$$$message_0053_0007_0001$$$::"Good work. Thanks, Emiyan."[lr]::
7606::$$$message_0053_0007_0002$$$::"You're welcome... Wait, this isn't the whole delivery, is it? If you came by car, there's probably more in the trunk."[lr]::
7607::$$$message_0053_0007_0003$$$::"Yep, there is. Two more just like these."[lr]::
7608::$$$message_0053_0007_0004$$$::"...I'll help.[lr]::
7609::$$$message_0053_0007_0005$$$::Do you always handle it like this, though? Furumi could just ask someone from the temple to pick it up."::
7610::$$$message_0053_0008_0000$$$::"It wouldn't be a good look to ask them.[lr]::
7611::$$$message_0053_0008_0001$$$::The temple monks feel awkward going out to buy alcohol themselves. It would be like Elliot Ness going on a bender. Drinking that much would ruin the taste of the liquor, too."[lr]::
7612::$$$message_0053_0008_0002$$$::Neko cackles.[lr]::
7613::$$$message_0053_0008_0003$$$::Now that she mentions it, they aren't supposed to consume alcohol here.::
7614::$$$message_0053_0009_0000$$$::"...Haah. Why don't we get Issei's permission to build a railcar? It shouldn't be too hard to make one that can carry things from the parking lot to the gate."[lr]::
7615::$$$message_0053_0009_0001$$$::"A railcar? Sounds cool! But won't that look bad to visitors if it goes right up to the gate?"[lr]::
7616::$$$message_0053_0009_0002$$$::"We'll build it through the forest so it goes around to the rear gate."::
7617::$$$message_0053_0010_0000$$$::"Wow. You're full of little tricks.[lr]::
7618::$$$message_0053_0010_0001$$$::That does sound nice, like a little freight trolley. I don't really mind either way, but it would help the granny who runs the rice store."[lr]::
7619::$$$message_0053_0010_0002$$$::...Hm.[lr]::
7620::$$$message_0053_0010_0003$$$::It sounds like Neko isn't too interested in modernizing her delivery system.::
7621::$$$message_0053_0011_0000$$$::"I think we can get it done in one more trip. Let's hop to it!"[lr]::
7622::$$$message_0053_0011_0001$$$::"Not two trips?"[lr]::
7623::$$$message_0053_0011_0002$$$::"Nope. We'll each take a load.[lr]::
7624::$$$message_0053_0011_0003$$$::Thirty kilos is no big deal for you, is it?"[lr]::
7625::$$$message_0053_0011_0004$$$::"...I can handle the weight, at least."::
7626::$$$message_0053_0012_0000$$$::But the packages are big enough for the need to wrap both arms around to hold.[lr]::
7627::$$$message_0053_0012_0001$$$::And we've got to climb that hellish set of stairs, too.[lr]::
7628::$$$message_0053_0012_0002$$$::...Actually, this would explain why Neko's always seemed unusually muscular.::
7629::$$$message_0053_0013_0000$$$::"...?"[lr]::
7630::$$$message_0053_0013_0001$$$::While on the way back to the temple courtyard from the kitchen,[lr]::
7631::$$$message_0053_0013_0002$$$::we come across something unbelievable.::
7632::$$$message_0053_0014_0000$$$::Fist violently meets fist.[lr]::
7633::$$$message_0053_0014_0001$$$::Two tall figures clash quietly yet swiftly.[lr]::
7634::$$$message_0053_0014_0002$$$::An incredible sparring match is happening in the rear garden.::
7635::$$$message_0053_0015_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
7636::$$$message_0053_0015_0001$$$::Neko is awestruck.[lr]::
7637::$$$message_0053_0015_0002$$$::It's only to be expected.[lr]::
7638::$$$message_0053_0015_0003$$$::[font italic=true]He's[font italic=false] one of the sparrers.[lr]::
7639::$$$message_0053_0015_0004$$$::Even if there were unique conditions that made it possible, in our first battle, Souichirou Kuzuki held his own, barehanded, against a Servant.::
7640::$$$message_0053_0016_0000$$$::"Hm. That's enough![lr]::
7641::$$$message_0053_0016_0001$$$::I must say, that was terrifying, Souichirou, even if you were pulling your punches."[lr]::
7642::$$$message_0053_0016_0002$$$::"...I had a strong opponent.[lr]::
7643::$$$message_0053_0016_0003$$$::While I did restrain myself, you didn't at all. Next time, consider stopping once you grab hold of my sleeve."::
7644::$$$message_0053_0017_0000$$$::The two men straighten their clothes as they talk.[lr]::
7645::$$$message_0053_0017_0001$$$::One is Kuzuki. The other is...[lr]::
7646::$$$message_0053_0017_0002$$$::"Oh, good morning,[lr]::
7647::$$$message_0053_0017_0003$$$::Shirou, Neko. I don't see you two together often."[lr]::
7648::$$$message_0053_0017_0004$$$::"..."[lr]::
7649::$$$message_0053_0017_0005$$$::...I think we make a perfectly normal duo, compared to you two.::
7650::$$$message_0053_0018_0000$$$::"Good morning, Reikan, Mr. Kuzuki.[lr]::
7651::$$$message_0053_0018_0001$$$::Were you...sparring?"[lr]::
7652::$$$message_0053_0018_0002$$$::"No, more like playing at it.[lr]::
7653::$$$message_0053_0018_0003$$$::I was dead serious, but Souichirou was pulling his punches just before hitting me. It looks like I'll need to train another ten years before I'm ready to spar with him."::
7654::$$$message_0053_0019_0000$$$::Reikan gives me a hearty chuckle.[lr]::
7655::$$$message_0053_0019_0001$$$::This paragon of tolerance is none other than Issei's older brother.::
7656::$$$message_0053_0020_0000$$$::"Wow. That's the first time I've ever seen you fail to throw someone, Rei. Is he from the temple?"[lr]::
7657::$$$message_0053_0020_0001$$$::"No, Souichirou Kuzuki here is a guest of the head monk.[lr]::
7658::$$$message_0053_0020_0002$$$::He's a teacher at Shirou's school."::
7659::$$$message_0053_0021_0000$$$::"Really? ...He doesn't exactly look respectable to me. Emiyan, do you know him?"[lr]::
7660::$$$message_0053_0021_0001$$$::"Of course. Mr. Kuzuki teaches modern society and ethics at our school. A lot of people call him the conscience of Homurahara, and he helps Fuji-nee out a lot, too."[lr]::
7661::$$$message_0053_0021_0002$$$::"Ugh. Oh, Fujimura knows him too.[lr]::
7662::$$$message_0053_0021_0003$$$::Sure, okay. Hello, I'm Neko Hotaruzuka. Nice to meet you."[lr]::
7663::$$$message_0053_0021_0004$$$::"Likewise. I am Souichirou Kuzuki."::
7664::$$$message_0053_0022_0000$$$::They greet each other politely.[lr]::
7665::$$$message_0053_0022_0001$$$::"Hm? Wait, Mr. Kuzuki, you've been living at the temple for a while now, but this is only your first time meeting Neko?"[lr]::
7666::$$$message_0053_0022_0002$$$::"...Yes. I have occasionally seen her around, but we've never spoken before.[lr]::
7667::$$$message_0053_0022_0003$$$::I will make sure to greet her from now on."::
7668::$$$message_0053_0023_0000$$$::His grim voice carries a ring of remorse.[lr]::
7669::$$$message_0053_0023_0001$$$::...I see. Souichirou Kuzuki isn't the sort of person to make new acquaintances on his own.[lr]::
7670::$$$message_0053_0023_0002$$$::From his perspective, he had no reason to involve himself with the woman delivering liquor.[lr]::
7671::$$$message_0053_0023_0003$$$::But that's only true for now.::
7672::$$$message_0053_0024_0000$$$::"You're amazing though, Mr. Kuzuki.[lr]::
7673::$$$message_0053_0024_0001$$$::Rei's been to the judo nationals, and he even trains the police. He couldn't keep up with you at all."::
7674::$$$message_0053_0025_0000$$$::"He sure is amazing.[lr]::
7675::$$$message_0053_0025_0001$$$::Souichirou is no ordinary man. He claims his skills have declined year by year, but I wonder what would have happened if he'd fought with me when he first arrived five years ago. My goodness."[lr]::
7676::$$$message_0053_0025_0002$$$::Reikan chuckles, adding that he probably would have died.[lr]::
7677::$$$message_0053_0025_0003$$$::...It's plausible enough to make me break into a cold sweat.::
7678::$$$message_0053_0026_0000$$$::"No, I'm only trained in one technique. You would dominate me in a grappling match, Reikan.[lr]::
7679::$$$message_0053_0026_0001$$$::You should give it a try sometime, Emiya. It would be a good learning experience for you."[lr]::
7680::$$$message_0053_0026_0002$$$::"Y-yes, sir.[lr]::
7681::$$$message_0053_0026_0003$$$::Oh, this is also my first time seeing you spar, Reikan. I normally see you meditating or cleaning."::
7682::$$$message_0053_0027_0000$$$::"That's a shame.[lr]::
7683::$$$message_0053_0027_0001$$$::My restraining techniques are a family tradition, actually. They're not something I can test out on people at a moment's notice, and moreover..."[lr]::
7684::$$$message_0053_0027_0002$$$::"They're meant to be used on the dragon god, right?[lr]::
7685::$$$message_0053_0027_0003$$$::Back when we were students, you used to say that when you were drunk. That idiot Fujimura would take the bait and yell, 'oh yeah, well here's my ultimate sword technique for catching tigers!'"::
7686::$$$message_0053_0028_0000$$$::Neko nods nostalgically.[lr]::
7687::$$$message_0053_0028_0001$$$::Also, Fuji-nee...swords aren't for [font italic=true]catching[font italic=false] tigers.::
7688::$$$message_0053_0029_0000$$$::"...It was meant to combat a dragon?[lr]::
7689::$$$message_0053_0029_0001$$$::Is it related to the festival for the dragon god of Mion River, in your local traditions?"[lr]::
7690::$$$message_0053_0029_0002$$$::"A Dragon God Festival?"::
7691::$$$message_0053_0030_0000$$$::"Oh, you didn't know, Emiyan?[lr]::
7692::$$$message_0053_0030_0001$$$::Mion River is the river that divides the town in half. Up until we were kids, they used to have this fall festival for it.[lr]::
7693::$$$message_0053_0030_0002$$$::Apparently, once upon a time, there was a raging dragon god who laid waste to Fuyuki, and an itinerant monk subjugated it. After that, the locals would hold festivals to appease the dragon every summer and fall. These days, we only hold the summer festival though."::
7694::$$$message_0053_0031_0000$$$::"Huh... Wait, don't tell me Ryudou Temple..."[lr]::
7695::$$$message_0053_0031_0001$$$::Did the monk build it on top of the dragon god's resting place?::
7696::$$$message_0053_0032_0000$$$::"I'm not sure.[lr]::
7697::$$$message_0053_0032_0001$$$::At the very least, that great monk's teachings were passed down.[lr]::
7698::$$$message_0053_0032_0002$$$::But we believe that that temple existed before that monk appeared here.[lr]::
7699::$$$message_0053_0032_0003$$$::It's that old chicken-or-egg question."::
7700::$$$message_0053_0033_0000$$$::"Uh-huh... Then, what if that monk used jiu-jitsu to beat the dragon and then settled down at Ryudou Temple afterward?"[lr]::
7701::$$$message_0053_0033_0001$$$::"That could be it.[lr]::
7702::$$$message_0053_0033_0002$$$::Who knows the actual truth, but this was supposedly a monk strong enough to beat a god. He must have been a virtuous monk with some serious dharmic power."::
7703::$$$message_0053_0034_0000$$$::"No, no. Dharmic power isn't something to strive for.[lr]::
7704::$$$message_0053_0034_0001$$$::Apparently, he talked the dragon down. The monk used his powers of eloquence to trick the dragon."[lr]::
7705::$$$message_0053_0034_0002$$$::Reikan sighs with adoration.[lr]::
7706::$$$message_0053_0034_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
7707::$$$message_0053_0034_0004$$$::He seems rather taken with the idea of winning without violence.::
7708::$$$message_0053_0035_0000$$$::"That's news to me. So you just practice judo as a hobby?"[lr]::
7709::$$$message_0053_0035_0001$$$::"Yeah. It's said that the dragon taught the temple residents martial arts as a pastime, but I wonder how much of that is true. It could be a tall tale.[lr]::
7710::$$$message_0053_0035_0002$$$::Even if it were true, it would run counter to Buddhist teachings. Though I don't deny that we're a corrupt bunch here."[lr]::
7711::$$$message_0053_0035_0003$$$::His good-natured chortling echoes through the temple again.::
7712::$$$message_0053_0036_0000$$$::"You can say that again.[lr]::
7713::$$$message_0053_0036_0001$$$::Yeah, Ryudou Temple's always been one of our regulars. I bet we'll be seeing more of your brother soon enough."[lr]::
7714::$$$message_0053_0036_0002$$$::"I wonder about that.[lr]::
7715::$$$message_0053_0036_0003$$$::Issei's practically an incarnation of our precepts. He doesn't even have it in him to break the rules. Even if I wanted to, I'd have a hard time steering him down the wrong path."::
7716::$$$message_0053_0037_0000$$$::"Hmm, so your brother's a straight shooter, huh? No wonder he's so popular with the Miyama shopping center association. [cacheimage storage=ネコ01b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ネコ01b(中)]You should be on top of things a little more too, Rei. Well, whatever.[lr]::
7717::$$$message_0053_0037_0001$$$::We're dropping off your order in the kitchen. We've gotta make one more trip, but I'd appreciate it if you could start opening the boxes in the meantime."::
7718::$$$message_0053_0038_0000$$$::"All right, got it. I'll hide them before the other scoundrels see them.[lr]::
7719::$$$message_0053_0038_0001$$$::And Neko, about what I asked before..."[lr]::
7720::$$$message_0053_0038_0002$$$::"I know, I threw in some extra.[lr]::
7721::$$$message_0053_0038_0003$$$::A lot of Demon Kings, too."[lr]::
7722::$$$message_0053_0038_0004$$$::"I knew I could count on you. That's good stuff."[lr]::
7723::$$$message_0053_0038_0005$$$::Demon King is a relatively expensive brand of shochu.[lr]::
7724::$$$message_0053_0038_0006$$$::But...::
7725::$$$message_0053_0039_0000$$$::"Um, Reikan. Are you sure you should be saying that so openly at the temple? I thought you were supposed to use code words like 'blessed water.'"[lr]::
7726::$$$message_0053_0039_0001$$$::"True, but it's no big deal. Either way, drinking won't get anyone excommunicated."::
7727::$$$message_0053_0040_0000$$$::"That's right. Even the chief monk holds banquets.[lr]::
7728::$$$message_0053_0040_0001$$$::Maybe drinking helps you achieve that no-self state. I bet it's faster than scourging yourself to get that endorphin hit."[lr]::
7729::$$$message_0053_0040_0002$$$::Neko's completely misunderstood what Buddhist temples practice.::
7730::$$$message_0053_0041_0000$$$::"Now now, Neko. We don't have any acolytes who are [font italic=true]that[font italic=false] wasteful.[lr]::
7731::$$$message_0053_0041_0001$$$::If you want to become enlightened, then work towards enlightenment. Separately, one should enjoy good liquor for what it is."[lr]::
7732::$$$message_0053_0041_0002$$$::And as we can see, Reikan isn't exactly the paragon of monkhood, either.::
7733::$$$message_0053_0042_0000$$$::"...Brother. Is this to be kept private from the rest of the monks here?"[lr]::
7734::$$$message_0053_0042_0001$$$::"Yes, it's a secret. Shirou, don't tell Issei, either.[lr]::
7735::$$$message_0053_0042_0002$$$::So, how about it, Souichirou? We can drink this extra shipment tonight.[lr]::
7736::$$$message_0053_0042_0003$$$::The other monks would raise a ruckus if they knew, so why don't we go moon-watching in the hills behind the temple?"::
7737::$$$message_0053_0043_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
7738::$$$message_0053_0043_0001$$$::Reikan casually invites Mr. Kuzuki out for a drink.[lr]::
7739::$$$message_0053_0043_0002$$$::But Mr. Kuzuki seems like he'd be even more of a straight-edge than Issei...::
7740::$$$message_0053_0044_0000$$$::"I don't object, but my wife, you see..."[lr]::
7741::$$$message_0053_0044_0001$$$::Why is he putting his glasses back on for that...?::
7742::$$$message_0053_0045_0000$$$::"I'd prefer to keep it from her, too.[lr]::
7743::$$$message_0053_0045_0001$$$::I get pretty nervous when Caster is around. The wine doesn't taste the same."[lr]::
7744::$$$message_0053_0045_0002$$$::"...Understood. Let us talk more later."[lr]::
7745::$$$message_0053_0045_0003$$$::He agreed!::
7746::$$$message_0053_0046_0000$$$::"Well, I'll let you handle this, Neko.[lr]::
7747::$$$message_0053_0046_0001$$$::Thanks for bringing up the rest."[lr]::
7748::$$$message_0053_0046_0002$$$::"And thanks for your business![lr]::
7749::$$$message_0053_0046_0003$$$::Um... I'll see you around, Mr. Kuzuki."[lr]::
7750::$$$message_0053_0046_0004$$$::"Yes. Until next time."::
7751::$$$message_0053_0047_0000$$$::We leave for the front gate, while Reikan and Kuzuki head towards the kitchen.[lr]::
7752::$$$message_0053_0047_0001$$$::Neko thoughtfully watches them leave.[lr]::
7753::$$$message_0053_0047_0002$$$::"Neko? We're going to pick up the rest of the goods, right?"[lr]::
7754::$$$message_0053_0047_0003$$$::"Yeah, I'm coming. Sorry, I was just wondering about that guy."[lr]::
7755::$$$message_0053_0047_0004$$$::"You mean Mr. Kuzuki?"[lr]::
7756::$$$message_0053_0047_0005$$$::"Yeah, him. I hate to admit it, but he's totally my type. That's the sort of man I'm into."[lr]::
7757::$$$message_0053_0047_0006$$$::"...What?"::
7758::$$$message_0053_0048_0000$$$::Neko starts walking, as if she didn't just drop a bombshell.[lr]::
7759::$$$message_0053_0048_0001$$$::"Uh..."[lr]::
7760::$$$message_0053_0048_0002$$$::I think this requires further explanation.[lr]::
7761::$$$message_0053_0048_0003$$$::"Neko. Mr. Kuzuki has a wife, you know."[lr]::
7762::$$$message_0053_0048_0004$$$::"I heard him. What about it?"[lr]::
7763::$$$message_0053_0048_0005$$$::"..."[lr]::
7764::$$$message_0053_0048_0006$$$::I don't even know where to begin...::
7765::$$$message_0053_0049_0000$$$::"I just admire people like that. I bet he could hold his drink and earnestly listen to what I have to say. Makes me wish I could join them for that evening drink."[lr]::
7766::$$$message_0053_0049_0001$$$::Neko laughs good-naturedly.[lr]::
7767::$$$message_0053_0049_0002$$$::"I see..."[lr]::
7768::$$$message_0053_0049_0003$$$::So that's what she meant.[lr]::
7769::$$$message_0053_0049_0004$$$::I don't think that's problematic...right?[lr]::
7770::$$$message_0053_0049_0005$$$::Mr. Kuzuki can be her new drinking buddy.::
7771::$$$message_0053_0050_0000$$$::"Let's go, Emiyan.[lr]::
7772::$$$message_0053_0050_0001$$$::We'd better get this done quick, after wasting all that time."[lr]::
7773::$$$message_0053_0050_0002$$$::We head back for the entrance.[lr]::
7774::$$$message_0053_0050_0003$$$::I think I'll be able to finish helping Neko before noon.::
907656::$$$message_9053_0020_0000$$$::"Wow. That's the first time I've ever seen you fail to throw someone, Rei. Is he from the temple?"[r]::x